# The save format promises byte-identical round-trips: loading a document and downloading
# it again produces the same bytes. Git normalising line endings on checkout would break
# that promise on Windows — the editor writes LF, the working tree would hold CRLF, and
# every save would look like a whole-file diff. So pin LF for everything textual.

* text=auto eol=lf

*.json  text eol=lf
*.js    text eol=lf
*.html  text eol=lf
*.css   text eol=lf
*.md    text eol=lf
